{"id": "33860", "title": "富气逼人嫁", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33860.htm", "intro": "人人都爱金龟婿，但她巫馥为了破除“无富”魔咒，只爱签乐透发大财，才不屑和大家一样追着黄金单身汉跑，虽然乐透从没中过奖，不过倒是有个意外的收获──每周两次和行销部独行侠来个杠龟后的快乐下午茶，只要喝了他亲手煮的爱心咖啡，她就精神百倍、脸色红润到大家都以为她在谈恋爱，还偷偷开赌盘赌他们两个是不是在一起，厚，有发财的机会都不找她参一脚……哎呀，不是啦，恋爱应该要双方都有意才谈得起来嘛，可是人家好像只当她是麻吉，还约她一起去相亲，害她坐在隔壁越看越心酸，正想祝他幸福、赶快逃走，却被他怒气冲冲的一把抓住，直奔楼上的……饭店房间？！", "base": "files/article/html/33/33860", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2153752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2153753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2153754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2153755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2153756.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2153757.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2153758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2153759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2153760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2153761.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2153762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2153763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2153764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2153765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2153766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2153767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2153768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2153769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2153770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2153771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2153772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2153773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2153774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2153775.html", "available": fal